      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The empathrem reacts aggressively to nearby creatures that don't keep their emotions in check. <em>Saving Throw:</em> DC 15 Wisdom, each creature in a 120-foot Emanation originating from the empathrem at the start of each of the empathrem's turns. A creature that is unaware of the empathrem's presence makes the saving throw with Disadvantage, and a creature under the effects of the <em>Calm Emotions</em> spell makes it with Advantage. A creature in a Rage loses Immunity to this effect and automatically fails saving throws against it. <em>Failure:</em> The empathrem has Advantage on attack rolls against the target for 1 minute, and the target automatically fails the saving throws against other empathrems' Violent Suppression traits for 1 hour. <em>Success:</em> The target is Immune to the effects of any empathrem's Violent Suppression for 1 hour.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
